WEBVTT

00:12.196 --> 00:13.322
All right, next!

00:15.299 --> 00:17.790
Sergeant Major Kusanagi, going down!

00:41.025 --> 00:44.927
Come on, it's too early for migration.

00:45.963 --> 00:48.193
Besides, where are they headed?

00:50.467 --> 00:52.799
A lot of things in this world...

00:53.837 --> 00:55.862
...have already started to break.

01:01.278 --> 01:05.180
Episode 18
Newborn

01:14.091 --> 01:15.058
Whoa.

01:16.694 --> 01:18.389
I-I'm sorry.

01:18.462 --> 01:19.827
Are you all right?

01:19.897 --> 01:21.387
I'm all right.

01:21.465 --> 01:22.454
What about you?

01:22.533 --> 01:24.262
I'm fine!

01:24.334 --> 01:25.301
I'm glad.

01:25.369 --> 01:26.893
I'm really sorry.

01:26.970 --> 01:28.665
I'm so clumsy...

01:28.739 --> 01:29.706
It's all right.

01:29.773 --> 01:31.434
Well, take care.

01:32.509 --> 01:33.737
Y-Yeah...

01:39.550 --> 01:41.643
He was pretty attractive, Inuki.

01:43.387 --> 01:46.288
He might look a little like Kusanagi...

01:46.356 --> 01:48.483
It kinda feels that way...

01:48.559 --> 01:49.787
I wonder why.

01:53.664 --> 01:54.631
Inuki?

01:54.698 --> 01:55.824
Let's go.

02:03.707 --> 02:05.106
Little lady!

02:05.175 --> 02:06.335
Kusanagi!

02:06.410 --> 02:08.071
Did you wait a long time?

02:08.145 --> 02:10.113
I thought I came here on time...

02:10.180 --> 02:11.977
No, I just got here.

02:12.049 --> 02:13.846
I see.

02:13.917 --> 02:16.681
Yo, have you been doing well, Inuki?

02:16.754 --> 02:18.415
There, there...

02:18.489 --> 02:20.457
Nothing's changed with you, right?

02:20.524 --> 02:25.359
Yup! You promised you'd tell me all about yourself today.

02:25.429 --> 02:27.590
T-That's right.

02:27.664 --> 02:29.962
Well, I don't have great stories to tell...

02:30.033 --> 02:32.729
Do you like sweets, Kusanagi?

02:32.803 --> 02:36.034
Yeah, I've got one heck of a sweet tooth, despite my looks.

02:36.106 --> 02:37.368
Really?

02:37.441 --> 02:40.410
I know a place that serves great chocolate parfaits!

02:44.615 --> 02:46.446
Yeah, this is delicious!

02:46.517 --> 02:50.283
It's kinda strange that you'd have such a big sweet tooth.

02:50.354 --> 02:52.879
I look like I'm a big drunkard.

02:54.291 --> 02:55.758
Oh, that's right.

02:55.826 --> 02:58.454
I met someone that looked like you just now.

02:58.529 --> 02:59.621
Like me?

02:59.696 --> 03:02.358
His presence felt really similar to yours.

03:02.432 --> 03:03.990
Especially how he smiled...

03:05.035 --> 03:09.165
Somewhat familiar, like I've met him somewhere else...

03:10.541 --> 03:12.338
Someone that resembles me...

03:12.409 --> 03:13.808
Yes, like you.

03:16.380 --> 03:18.075
Perhaps...

03:18.148 --> 03:19.706
Is it someone you know?

03:19.783 --> 03:24.413
Well, I'm not sure if he's the one you met.

03:24.488 --> 03:28.049
But the guy I know doesn't exactly resemble me...

03:28.125 --> 03:31.526
It's more like he resembles yet doesn't resemble everyone.

03:31.595 --> 03:33.426
Like he threw away his self...

03:33.497 --> 03:37.228
...to play the role that people in front of him wish.

03:37.301 --> 03:39.394
As people wish?

03:39.469 --> 03:43.064
I don't think that's all too fortunate.

03:43.140 --> 03:44.107
I see...

03:44.174 --> 03:46.574
Well, that was a strange turn of things.

03:46.643 --> 03:48.133
Sorry.

03:48.212 --> 03:49.338
But that's...

03:52.649 --> 03:54.742
Inuki, you're acting strange.

03:54.818 --> 03:55.785
What's wrong?

04:09.032 --> 04:10.556
A Dragon of Earth...

04:10.634 --> 04:13.865
Jeez, this has got to be the worst timing!

04:15.339 --> 04:16.636
Kusanagi, I...

04:16.707 --> 04:19.232
Um, just remembered an important errand.

04:19.309 --> 04:20.708
Can I see you again later?

04:20.777 --> 04:23.371
S-Sure, I don't mind...

04:23.447 --> 04:25.540
Then I'll make sure to contact you!

04:25.616 --> 04:26.742
H-Hey!

04:26.817 --> 04:28.045
I'm sorry!

04:28.118 --> 04:29.244
Little lady!

05:16.199 --> 05:19.396
I know a Dragon of Earth is doing this.

05:19.469 --> 05:21.300
Stop hiding and come out!

05:44.995 --> 05:46.758
Why are you doing this?

05:46.830 --> 05:48.991
An earthquake might hurt someone.

05:49.066 --> 05:51.261
Someone might even die from this.

05:51.335 --> 05:52.996
You do this knowing that?

05:56.239 --> 05:58.537
You don't care if someone dies?

05:58.608 --> 06:00.337
Answer me!

06:00.410 --> 06:01.877
This girl...

06:01.945 --> 06:03.674
She's the one...

06:03.747 --> 06:06.648
Hey, Inuki, it's a good thing we came to Tokyo.

06:10.554 --> 06:12.249
G-Good morning...

06:12.322 --> 06:13.448
Are you on a walk?

06:29.439 --> 06:31.373
Y-You're...

06:31.441 --> 06:32.703
Yes.

06:32.776 --> 06:36.234
It's surprising that we're both Dragons of Earth and Heaven.

06:36.313 --> 06:39.111
By the way, about your question...

06:39.182 --> 06:43.312
Before I answer, I have something that I want to ask you.

06:43.387 --> 06:44.718
Is that all right?

06:44.788 --> 06:46.050
Fine!

06:46.123 --> 06:47.886
Then I'll ask you...

06:47.958 --> 06:50.188
Why can't I kill humans?

06:51.428 --> 06:53.919
I mean, isn't that obvious?

06:53.997 --> 06:56.363
Why is it obvious?

06:56.433 --> 06:57.764
W-Why?

06:58.802 --> 07:03.466
Humans kill all sorts of creatures, but that can be forgiven?

07:04.608 --> 07:06.576
Because we can't communicate?

07:06.643 --> 07:08.634
Because their intelligence is lower?

07:08.712 --> 07:11.909
So if it can't communicate and has lower intelligence...

07:11.982 --> 07:13.313
...it's all right to kill?

07:13.383 --> 07:14.509
N-No...

07:14.584 --> 07:15.846
That's right.

07:15.919 --> 07:21.186
But you've lived till now by taking the lives of many other creatures.

07:21.258 --> 07:24.091
Eating meat, eating plants, soiling the forest...

07:24.161 --> 07:27.153
...polluting the ocean, and taking other lives.

07:28.198 --> 07:30.189
Is that because humans are special?

07:31.234 --> 07:32.531
No...

07:32.602 --> 07:34.263
Creatures other than humans...

07:34.337 --> 07:38.467
...kill other creatures only to eat and survive.

07:38.542 --> 07:40.339
But humans are different.

07:40.410 --> 07:42.901
They kill their own over inconveniences...

07:42.979 --> 07:45.709
...as well as other creatures.

07:45.782 --> 07:48.273
N-Not everyone is like that!

07:48.351 --> 07:49.375
That's true.

07:49.453 --> 07:54.390
But it is a fact that people who are like that live by killing others.

07:54.458 --> 07:57.291
So why are humans the only things...

07:57.360 --> 07:59.828
...not allowed to be the victims?

07:59.896 --> 08:03.093
Because humans are stronger than other creatures?

08:03.166 --> 08:06.658
If a creature is stronger, is killing humans all right?

08:06.736 --> 08:07.703
No...

08:07.771 --> 08:09.534
No is not a valid answer.

08:10.574 --> 08:12.337
I'll ask you once more.

08:12.409 --> 08:15.242
Why can't we kill humans?

08:15.312 --> 08:17.610
T-That's because...

08:17.681 --> 08:18.909
Answer me.

08:18.982 --> 08:21.712
Why can't we kill humans?

08:21.785 --> 08:23.082
That's because...

08:24.688 --> 08:25.655
Answer me.

08:28.158 --> 08:29.682
Inuki!

08:40.871 --> 08:42.168
Inuki...

08:43.573 --> 08:44.631
Inuki...

08:50.680 --> 08:51.647
Inuki...

08:53.550 --> 08:56.246
Inuki, don't...

08:56.319 --> 08:57.877
I don't want you to go...

09:00.924 --> 09:02.983
Inuki, don't go!

09:23.713 --> 09:24.737
That's a difficult question...

09:27.217 --> 09:28.684
Poor thing.

09:28.752 --> 09:30.413
That Dragon of Heaven girl...

09:30.487 --> 09:33.388
...was about to cry because she couldn't answer.

09:33.456 --> 09:35.651
An answer based on an ethical viewpoint.

09:35.725 --> 09:37.317
An idealistic answer.

09:37.394 --> 09:38.952
A biological answer.

09:40.363 --> 09:43.059
There are many things that can serve as the answer.

09:43.133 --> 09:45.761
But none of them are complete answers.

09:46.803 --> 09:48.998
What do you think, Yuto?

09:49.072 --> 09:51.233
Well, I think it's probably because...

09:52.275 --> 09:54.038
...there are people who would be sad.

09:56.146 --> 09:59.912
Well, I just thought an answer of that sort would be nice.

10:00.951 --> 10:02.543
Now let's go have some tea.

10:03.587 --> 10:05.350
Kanoe is waiting for us.

10:16.566 --> 10:18.397
Inuki?

10:18.468 --> 10:19.435
Inuki?

10:22.038 --> 10:25.030
Inuki, what are you doing in a place like this?

10:29.412 --> 10:31.403
Wait, where are you going?

10:31.481 --> 10:33.608
Wait, don't go, Inuki!

10:33.683 --> 10:34.672
Don't go!

10:34.751 --> 10:35.718
Inuki!

10:37.387 --> 10:39.218
Are you all right, little lady?

10:43.660 --> 10:45.287
Kusanagi?

10:45.362 --> 10:46.329
This is?

10:46.396 --> 10:47.920
Don't worry.

10:47.998 --> 10:50.762
This is the defense force base medical room.

10:56.339 --> 10:57.863
Inuki...

10:59.309 --> 11:02.210
Because I couldn't answer the question, Inuki...

11:03.246 --> 11:06.147
Why can't we kill humans?

11:06.216 --> 11:09.151
I didn't know how to answer that question.

11:09.219 --> 11:11.619
I couldn't say anything...

11:12.656 --> 11:14.749
I thought I needed to say something...

11:14.824 --> 11:16.689
...and I got even more confused.

11:17.727 --> 11:19.854
I couldn't do anything...

11:21.231 --> 11:23.563
Inuki covered for me...

11:23.633 --> 11:25.100
...and so it's my fault.

11:27.137 --> 11:29.128
It's not your fault, little lady.

11:29.205 --> 11:30.968
It is my fault!

11:31.041 --> 11:33.100
It's because I couldn't answer.

11:35.145 --> 11:37.340
You're fully aware of it.

11:38.381 --> 11:39.780
The answer.

11:39.849 --> 11:41.214
I don't know!

11:41.284 --> 11:42.410
You do know.

11:43.420 --> 11:44.387
See?

11:44.454 --> 11:46.012
This is your answer.

11:47.924 --> 11:50.154
Why can't you kill humans?

11:51.194 --> 11:53.321
It's because someone else will cry.

11:54.364 --> 11:55.956
Not just humans.

11:56.032 --> 11:58.330
Why you can't kill another creature...

11:58.401 --> 12:01.165
...is because some being will always be sad about it.

12:01.237 --> 12:04.536
Aren't you sad when someone dies?

12:04.607 --> 12:06.700
Even if it's not someone you know...

12:06.776 --> 12:08.641
Even if it's not a human?

12:08.712 --> 12:10.509
I'm sad.

12:10.580 --> 12:13.310
Everyone is saddened by death.

12:13.383 --> 12:18.286
Whether it's someone you know or not, they're sure to be sad.

12:18.355 --> 12:21.552
So that's why you can't kill anyone.

12:21.624 --> 12:22.886
Don't you think so?

12:23.927 --> 12:26.589
Because someone will cry?

12:26.663 --> 12:27.960
That's right.

12:28.031 --> 12:33.264
So cry to your heart's content and grieve for Inuki's sake.

12:47.384 --> 12:49.375
To think she's a Dragon of Heaven...

12:49.452 --> 12:51.477
...and I'm a Dragon of Earth.

12:51.554 --> 12:53.920
What an ironic turn of events.

13:00.563 --> 13:01.587
Are you all right?

13:01.664 --> 13:02.858
Yes.

13:02.932 --> 13:05.093
Thank you very much for the clothes.

13:05.168 --> 13:08.626
Your uniform got pretty dirty.

13:08.705 --> 13:11.970
But I don't know much about girls' clothes.

13:12.041 --> 13:15.533
I should have asked what you liked before I bought those.

13:15.612 --> 13:16.943
That's not true!

13:17.013 --> 13:19.311
I really like these clothes.

13:19.382 --> 13:21.942
It's because you chose them for me.

13:22.018 --> 13:23.508
I-I see...

13:23.586 --> 13:24.985
I'm glad.

13:25.054 --> 13:26.885
I, um...

13:29.826 --> 13:32.954
I like you very much, Kusanagi.

13:37.200 --> 13:42.536
A-Are you troubled that I like you so much, Kusanagi?

13:50.513 --> 13:52.538
Of course not.

13:52.615 --> 13:57.552
Who wouldn't be happy to have a cute girl say she likes you.

13:57.620 --> 13:59.884
- But...
- I know.

13:59.956 --> 14:03.653
To you, I'm still a child.

14:03.726 --> 14:05.318
But still, I...

14:05.395 --> 14:08.592
I want to know more and more about you.

14:08.665 --> 14:11.361
And I want you to know more about me.

14:13.203 --> 14:14.363
Is that bad?

14:16.105 --> 14:18.699
No, I feel the same way.

14:22.946 --> 14:24.345
I'm so glad...

14:24.414 --> 14:25.381
Thank you.

14:26.349 --> 14:28.044
I'll be going now.

14:28.117 --> 14:29.243
Y-Yeah...

14:31.087 --> 14:32.384
Be careful.

14:36.192 --> 14:37.489
Inuki...

14:37.560 --> 14:39.687
I told Kusanagi that I liked him.

14:40.730 --> 14:43.358
He told me that I can keep liking him.

15:17.166 --> 15:18.656
You're yesterday's...

15:19.702 --> 15:21.693
You don't seem as energetic today.

15:23.740 --> 15:25.833
Is making a Barrier impossible?

15:27.010 --> 15:28.238
A Dragon of Earth?

15:28.311 --> 15:29.642
What if I am?

15:52.101 --> 15:54.069
He's missing on purpose!

16:28.471 --> 16:32.339
All that effort to create a new Barrier Field was wasted.

16:32.408 --> 16:34.000
I won't let you do that!

16:38.181 --> 16:40.115
Do I look like someone?

16:42.251 --> 16:43.684
You don't look the same...

16:44.721 --> 16:46.882
You don't look like anyone!

16:46.956 --> 16:50.357
But you seem to be pushing yourself a bit.

16:51.361 --> 16:52.555
I see.

16:52.629 --> 16:55.462
It must be because you lost something dear to you.

16:55.531 --> 16:56.793
I know.

16:56.866 --> 17:00.529
It's better to die than face this much pain.

17:01.571 --> 17:03.095
You think so.

17:03.172 --> 17:04.264
Am I wrong?

17:06.309 --> 17:08.436
Looks like you can't answer again.

17:13.783 --> 17:15.011
Let's make sure.

17:17.820 --> 17:21.688
If you truly wish that you don't want to die...

17:22.725 --> 17:24.158
...you won't die.

17:27.330 --> 17:28.797
Inuki...

17:28.865 --> 17:31.766
Inuki saved this life of mine.

17:31.834 --> 17:33.324
If I die...

17:33.403 --> 17:35.769
...Inuki will grieve the most.

17:37.140 --> 17:39.700
He might be happy to be reunited with you.

17:40.910 --> 17:42.775
No... No!

17:42.845 --> 17:44.904
If my Barrier Field breaks...

17:44.981 --> 17:46.744
...many people will die.

17:46.816 --> 17:48.283
Many people will be sad.

17:49.318 --> 17:51.218
Right, Kusanagi?

17:52.255 --> 17:54.917
If all the humans die...

17:54.991 --> 17:57.516
...then there wouldn't be anyone left to grieve.

17:57.593 --> 18:00.061
No, I don't want that!

18:00.129 --> 18:01.926
I absolutely don't want that!

18:02.965 --> 18:05.525
I'm sure that would make Inuki sad!

18:05.601 --> 18:07.831
How do you know that?

18:07.904 --> 18:09.462
That thing's no longer here.

18:09.539 --> 18:10.506
He's here!

18:10.573 --> 18:13.701
Inuki is right here inside my heart!

18:13.776 --> 18:16.643
So I'll do my best!

18:18.414 --> 18:19.711
I won't cry anymore.

18:19.782 --> 18:22.717
So that nobody else has such sad feelings...

18:23.853 --> 18:25.047
I'll protect everyone!

18:26.055 --> 18:27.022
I promise!

19:10.666 --> 19:15.296
It looks like her feelings that she didn't want to die were true.

19:23.079 --> 19:25.547
You were this close to killing me.

19:26.516 --> 19:27.608
Right?

19:27.683 --> 19:29.173
Who knows?

19:29.252 --> 19:31.186
You're a Dragon of Earth...

19:31.254 --> 19:33.882
...yet you're changing over to be a Dragon of Heaven?

19:33.956 --> 19:35.685
It's not exactly that...

19:37.059 --> 19:38.219
But how things went...

19:39.262 --> 19:41.389
An interesting fellow.

19:41.464 --> 19:43.159
Not as much as you.

19:57.547 --> 20:00.710
You came out from inside my heart?

20:01.751 --> 20:03.514
That's right...

20:03.586 --> 20:06.054
Thank you for protecting me.

20:08.357 --> 20:11.224
Will you be at my side from now on?

20:12.829 --> 20:14.660
I'll give you a name.

20:14.730 --> 20:16.630
You're Inuki.

20:17.667 --> 20:19.225
Isn't that a good name?

20:20.636 --> 20:23.264
This time, we'll be together forever.

20:24.307 --> 20:25.899
Right, Inuki?
